"experimental.predictedLowEvidenceFooter" = "Consider IOB and recent glucose cuts false warnings: the alert then needs a falling trend and carbs on board that do not cover the drop. It warns at once when glucose is within 15 mg/dL (0.8 mmol/L) of the value, would reach it within 10 minutes, or insulin acting in the next 30 minutes explains the drop. With no insulin on board, a fall that only returns from a recent rise waits. Otherwise a second reading must confirm it. The Low and Very Low alarms are not affected.";
